    "body": "The last three commits in this branch — ba3d723, 9eb5f6b, and c37da77 — are less strictly necessary, since they’re just microdata identifiers rather URLs we intend for people to actually navigate to. But maybe our editorial policy should be that we use https URLs for those too — if they’re available over https (compared to, e.g., microformats.org resources, which are http-only).",
